windowrule = opacity 1.0 $& 1.0 $& 1,match:class ^(qt5ct)$
windowrule = opacity 1.0 $& 1.0 $& 1,match:class ^(qt6ct)$
windowrule = opacity 1.0 $& 1.0 $& 1,match:class ^(kvantummanager)$
